<title>USA: GenRad Inc names Paul Pronsky CFO.</title>
<headline>GenRad Inc names Paul Pronsky CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CONCORD, Mass. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>GenRad Inc said Tuesday that Paul Pronsky has been elected chief financial officer and vice president, effective December 13.</p>
<p>The company said Pronsky succeeds Dan Harrington, who resigned to join a start-up company in New Hampshire.</p>
<p>Pronsky has been GenRad's vice president of operations and analysis, the company said.</p>
